@baseUrl = http://localhost:5135

### Liveness: 200 "Healthy", never touches a dependency
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### A correlation ID sent by the caller is echoed in X-Correlation-ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Correlation-ID: demo-request-001

### A12: an invalid correlation ID is replaced with a generated one, and the request still succeeds
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Correlation-ID: not valid;id

### A13: an unknown route returns 404 ProblemDetails with correlationId
GET {{baseUrl}}/no-such-route

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
